 disallowed period, and `book` throws when the item is not free. Booking ids are sequential (`booking-1`, …)
 to keep the service deterministic.
 
-Not yet implemented: cancellations. The policy (no refund when cancelled less than 24 hours before the
-start, full refund otherwise) is reserved for that later work.
+- `cancel(bookingId, at)`: cancels the booking at the instant `at` (a UTC ISO-8601 string) and returns
+  `{ bookingId, refund }`, in euro cents. The refund is the full `total` when `at` is at least 24 hours before the
+  start, and nothing otherwise (including after the start). The equipment is free again for the cancelled period.
